 version would be fine~ \n\nHe is a \u201ccute masculine\u201d body type and is based on a light blue and white parakeet bird, with a short light blue haircut that has 90s style bangs and sticks out at the bottom, fluffy wings on his head in place of ears, small fangs, large gold round glasses and a large hooded jacket that has sleeves like feathers, oval blush that is permanently on his cheeks, a beauty mark right by his left eye, along with shoes that resemble a bird's claws and feet. There is also a small patch of black speckles on his jacket shoulders, like in the references~\n\nI would love any sort of pose or extra details/ accessories of the costume that you're inspired to draw if you accept my request, and for the colors palette they are mostly shades of light blues, white, green for the eyes, peach for the permanent blush, and gold for accents! Also a transparent version as well if it's okay!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bmXwr4XFITooFTuWDXr3FFZn_TCCjBg9", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@am_o0zz/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2303553, "client_id": 2135661, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da077138f54c5f929745d3d9d1d24398", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da077138f54c5f929745d3d9d1d24398, https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f00ad00b0102588fc23e281c9efa7f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bdb40449/uploads/origins/63e9a151-0302-47c9-9998-e9f77f554404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccom